From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7915: connect HG5585F NPU receive and reorder

Connect the opt-in legacy firmware to MT7916 input and host return rings.
Use the verified 512-entry input geometry, physical band and PCIe mapping.
Preserve native transmit and MCU/event queues, and return received frames
to Linux instead of using the incompatible upstream PPE firmware ABI.

Give coherent descriptors to the supplier until a verified stop; keep all
DMA memory on failure. Disable native data polling for firmware-owned
queues, handle probe unwind, and restart the MAC and NPU together so BA
state is re-established after recovery.

